From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wsdapi: scope matching, ResolveMatches, UDP address serialization, XML context registration (3649)

wsdapi: scope matching, ResolveMatches, UDP address (de)serialization, XML context registration

MatchProbeEx now matches the scopes of a probe (rfc3986, strcmp0, uuid, ldap and registered
IWSDScopeMatchingRule rules), the probe parser reads Scopes and MatchBy, MatchResolve(Ex)
answers a Resolve for the publisher's endpoint with ResolveMatches, Register/UnRegister
ScopeMatchingRule, IWSDUdpAddress::Serialize/Deserialize, IWSDXMLContext::SetNamespaces/SetTypes,
GetLowerParameters (and its missing WINAPI), more WS_XML_TEXT types. WSD_RESOLVE added to wsdtypes.h.
---
